name: "✨ Feature request / 新功能"
description: Propose a concrete improvement / 提出具体的功能改进
title: "[Feature]: "
labels:
  - enhancement
body:
  - type: markdown
    attributes:
      value: |
        For early-stage ideas or open-ended design questions, start with [GitHub Discussions](https://github.com/{{projectName}}/discussions). Use this form when the use case and desired outcome are concrete.

        对于早期想法或开放式设计讨论，请先使用 [GitHub Discussions](https://github.com/{{projectName}}/discussions)。使用本表单提交目标明确的功能需求。

  - type: checkboxes
    id: prerequisites
    attributes:
      label: Prerequisites / 提交前检查
      options:
        - label: I searched existing issues and discussions for similar proposals. / 我已搜索类似的 Issue 和 Discussions。
          required: true

  - type: dropdown
    id: area
    attributes:
      label: Affected area / 涉及范围
      options:
        - Tools / 工具
        - Resources / 资源
        - Prompts / 提示词
        - stdio transport / stdio 传输
        - Streamable HTTP transport / Streamable HTTP 传输
        - Server API or lifecycle / 服务端 API 或生命周期
        - CLI or configuration / CLI 或配置
        - Package or build output / 包或构建产物
        - Documentation or examples / 文档或示例
        - Other / 其他
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: textarea
    id: problem
    attributes:
      label: Problem or use case / 问题或使用场景
      description: Explain the user need rather than only describing an API shape. / 请说明用户需求，而不只是描述 API 形式。
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: textarea
    id: proposed-solution
    attributes:
      label: Proposed solution / 建议方案
      description: Describe the expected behavior and include an API, protocol, or command-line example when useful. / 请描述预期行为，必要时提供 API、协议或命令行示例。
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: textarea
    id: alternatives
    attributes:
      label: Alternatives considered / 考虑过的替代方案

  - type: textarea
    id: additional-context
    attributes:
      label: Additional context / 其他信息
      description: Add examples, screenshots, prior art, or links to a related discussion. / 可补充示例、截图、参考实现或相关讨论。

  - type: checkboxes
    id: contribution
    attributes:
      label: Contribution / 参与实现
      options:
        - label: I am willing to help implement or test this feature. / 我愿意协助实现或测试此功能。
